From 2dca71733ae6e14235e8c92df35c0118ed2055d5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Majid Arasskhani <M.Arasskhani@gosilkroad.net>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 22:56:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] refactor(frontend): move ChatPanel's pure message
 helpers into lib
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

18 stateless helpers (prompt-thread removal, payload readers, export
eligibility, direction, queue previews, timing titles) leave ChatPanel.tsx
for src/lib/chatPanelMessages.ts, where they get their first unit tests —
including removePromptThreadFromMessages, which the prompt-deletion PUT now
relies on to reconcile against the full server history.

ChatPanel.tsx: 7517 → 7318 lines. The remaining split (ChatSidebar,
Composer, MediaGeneration, StreamController hook, AgentPanel, ExportMenu)
needs the sidebar/pagination state moved into hooks first — the sidebar JSX
alone reads 65 component-scoped identifiers — and is left for Phase 5.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UTnpHajSmkk2JMLfuQoV7o
